  <revision rev="3" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>4528e41ed4ae8d3ccf15d3737a02e7d1</srcmd5>
    <version>2026.3</version>
    <time>1795294039</time>
    <user>dimstar_suse</user>
    <comment>- update to 2026.3:
  * Add airport_weather dataset with daily observations for six
    US airports.
  * Add wind_observations dataset with a worldwide METAR
    snapshot.
  * Remove world_countries dataset, API, and boundary data.
  * Store geographic boundaries in an internal SQLite database
    (geographic_boundaries.db) using WKB geometries.
  * Add records() API to us_states and us_counties returning
    Shapely Polygon/MultiPolygon geometries.
  * Consolidate stock tables into stocks.csv.gz and add unified
    stocks.data DataFrame.
  * Consolidate Gapminder tables into gapminder.csv.gz and add
    unified gapminder.data DataFrame.
  * Compress large CSV and JSON datasets with gzip (CGM,
    SampleSuperstore, cycling, emissions, population, routes,
    unemployment09, us_cities, world_cities).
  * Replace static daylight CSV with daylight_for_year()
    calculating solar times using NOAA formulas.
  * Add unemployment.by_fips mapping to join with county
    records.
  * Update airport_routes to July 2026 BTS domestic flights and
    OurAirports identifiers.
  * Replace browser icons with Font Awesome Free 6.7.2 assets.
  * Generate us_holidays programmatically from calendar rules
    and OPM federal guidelines.
  * Load large dataset attributes lazily via __getattr__.
  * Defer pandas import during package initialization.
  * Add comprehensive dataset provenance and license metadata
    under licenses/ and datasets.json.</comment>
    <requestid>1399565</requestid>
  </revision>
</revisionlist>
